                    <td><b>Candy</b></td>
                    <td class="center">[캔디]</td>
                    <td>사탕</td>
                    <td class="center">초등 필수 단어 📖</td>
                    <td class="center created">⭕ 제작완료</td>
                    <td>Don't eat too much candy or you'll get cavities.</td>
                    <td>사탕 너무 많이 먹으면 이 썩는다.</td>
                </tr>
            
